(7723445, 1271578, 124815, '<td valign="top">Poor Vincent. It seems like blasphemy what they do now with his work, so ignored and despised in his time. All these annoy me terribly.<br/>I really cannot vote on this.</td>', 'Poor Vincent. It seems like blasphemy what they do now with his work, so ignored and despised in his time. All these annoy me terribly.I really cannot vote on this.', '2022-07-15 15:55:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(7723537, 1271651, 103142, '<td valign="top">I like the idea quite a bit, but it doesn''t seem to blend well at the bottom. And the shadow on the wall seems awfully dark for the composition. Also, it seems sepia toned at the top, but more blueish down at the bottom. I''d like the tones to work together a bit more. Maybe it would blend better then. 6</td>', 'I like the idea quite a bit, but it doesn''t seem to blend well at the bottom. And the shadow on the wall seems awfully dark for the composition. Also, it seems sepia toned at the top, but more blueish down at the bottom. I''d like the tones to work together a bit more. Maybe it would blend better then. 6', '2022-07-18 11:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7723542, 1271277, 75585, '<td valign="top">This is so cute - personally I think having the dog AND reflection given equal spacing would have really made this impactful.  Of course, moving dog makes that VERY difficult to do, so hats off on a good capture!</td>', 'This is so cute - personally I think having the dog AND reflection given equal spacing would have really made this impactful.  Of course, moving dog makes that VERY difficult to do, so hats off on a good capture!', '2022-07-18 13:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
